Model Defense (3.02s) | Title: Model Uncertainty Analysis: Residual Distribution | Pose: answer | Links: 2
  [METHODOLOGY]:
    The 95% pooled forward-test residual distribution is derived from the Gradient Boosting Regressor's performance on unseen validation data. It represents the range of prediction errors (actual minus predicted change in live coral cover) across the 40 monitoring units, capturing the model's inherent variance and sensitivity to input features.
  [COMPUTATION STEPS]:
